# ==============================================================================
# Strict Allowlist: 仅提交 skills/ 与 README.md
# ==============================================================================

# 1. 默认忽略根目录下的一切文件与目录 (tests, tools, test_workspace, scratch 等全被屏蔽)
/*

# 2. 根目录白名单：仅允许 .gitignore 与 README.md
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/README.MD
!/readme.md

# 3. 目录白名单：允许 skills 目录及其所有内容
!/skills/
!/skills/**

# 4. 安全底线：严禁 skills/ 内部产生并提交任何测试产物与运行缓存
skills/**/__pycache__/
skills/**/*.py[cod]
skills/**/$py.class
skills/**/*.docx
skills/**/*.doc
skills/**/*.dotx
skills/**/*.pdf
skills/**/*.png
skills/**/*.jpg
skills/**/*.jpeg
skills/**/*.gif
skills/**/*.webp
skills/**/*.tmp
skills/**/*.temp
skills/**/*.log
skills/**/*.bak
